    "detailed_description": "<h1>Burning Skies</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br>Lt Blitz has the city  sieged, and it's your job to destroy his troops. Shoot, dodge and upgrade your jet and and try to take on this challenge! Burning Skies is a free, endless retro shmup, that will take you right back to the era of arcade machines, with modernized graphics and gameplay!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/91ded3cff17fef1bc2efa47c1c84a816.poster.avif?t=1725479401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/91ded3cff17fef1bc2efa47c1c84a816.webm?t=1725479401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/91ded3cff17fef1bc2efa47c1c84a816.mp4?t=1725479401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Blast through waves of enemies, improving your jet and equiping it with one of the multiple available weapons!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/a3160c49a4d9c9451529c1aa172bac29.poster.avif?t=1725479401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/a3160c49a4d9c9451529c1aa172bac29.webm?t=1725479401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/a3160c49a4d9c9451529c1aa172bac29.mp4?t=1725479401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Beat the lieutenant Blitz and, mighty war machine, and the army of General Bloodmester!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/672348f816d94035bd0a279d28ff5e9b.poster.avif?t=1725479401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/672348f816d94035bd0a279d28ff5e9b.webm?t=1725479401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/672348f816d94035bd0a279d28ff5e9b.mp4?t=1725479401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Perfect to play when you need just a shot of quick fun! This is a short and free love letter to the 80s arcade games. Inspired by classics like 1942, River Raid, Raiden and more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/bce7180f0138aa62f159c39538cb0946.poster.avif?t=1725479401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/bce7180f0138aa62f159c39538cb0946.webm?t=1725479401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/bce7180f0138aa62f159c39538cb0946.mp4?t=1725479401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Beautiful 3D voxel graphics;<br></li><li>Endless procedurally generated gameplay;<br></li><li>Various unique enemies, weapons and a very challenging boss fight;<br></li><li>Original Music</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br>Lt Blitz has the city  sieged, and it's your job to destroy his troops. Shoot, dodge and upgrade your jet and and try to take on this challenge! Burning Skies is a free, endless retro shmup, that will take you right back to the era of arcade machines, with modernized graphics and gameplay!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/91ded3cff17fef1bc2efa47c1c84a816.poster.avif?t=1725479401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/91ded3cff17fef1bc2efa47c1c84a816.webm?t=1725479401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/91ded3cff17fef1bc2efa47c1c84a816.mp4?t=1725479401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Blast through waves of enemies, improving your jet and equiping it with one of the multiple available weapons!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/a3160c49a4d9c9451529c1aa172bac29.poster.avif?t=1725479401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/a3160c49a4d9c9451529c1aa172bac29.webm?t=1725479401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/a3160c49a4d9c9451529c1aa172bac29.mp4?t=1725479401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Beat the lieutenant Blitz and, mighty war machine, and the army of General Bloodmester!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/672348f816d94035bd0a279d28ff5e9b.poster.avif?t=1725479401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/672348f816d94035bd0a279d28ff5e9b.webm?t=1725479401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/672348f816d94035bd0a279d28ff5e9b.mp4?t=1725479401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Perfect to play when you need just a shot of quick fun! This is a short and free love letter to the 80s arcade games. Inspired by classics like 1942, River Raid, Raiden and more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/bce7180f0138aa62f159c39538cb0946.poster.avif?t=1725479401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/bce7180f0138aa62f159c39538cb0946.webm?t=1725479401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290190/extras/bce7180f0138aa62f159c39538cb0946.mp4?t=1725479401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Beautiful 3D voxel graphics;<br></li><li>Endless procedurally generated gameplay;<br></li><li>Various unique enemies, weapons and a very challenging boss fight;<br></li><li>Original Music</li></ul>",
